{"id":"bangkok","name":"曼谷","en":"Bangkok","country":"Thailand","lat":13.756,"lng":100.502,"dek":"一座把金顶、热气和河声叠在旧城里的都城","history":"曼谷的起点，通常被追溯到十五世纪阿瑜陀耶时期。当时它还只是昭披耶河口的一个小集镇，因靠近河口、便于贸易而逐渐受到重视。十七世纪那莱王在位时，法国工程师德拉马雷受命在河东岸修筑星形要塞，法军一度驻扎在此。1688年暹罗内乱，法军被逐出，这座河边聚落重新回到暹罗自己的轨道。\n\n1767年，阿瑜陀耶被缅军攻破焚毁，郑昭在昭披耶河西岸的吞武里建立新都。新的中心只持续了十余年。1782年，通銮建立扎克里王朝，将都城迁到对岸的拉达那哥欣岛，也就是今天的曼谷旧城核心。4月21日国柱树立，被认为建城之日。此后拉玛一世修建宫殿、城墙和最早的几条街道，其中三聘街后来成为华人商业最集中的地带。\n\n十九世纪中后期，拉玛四世蒙固和拉玛五世朱拉隆功推行西化改革，曼谷开始铺设马路和铁路，有了出版社、医院和新式学校，城市面貌从河网小镇转向近代都城。二十世纪，曼谷既是泰国经济增长的中心，也是多次政变和群众运动的发生地。1972年曼谷大都会管理局成立，次年河两岸的拍那空省与吞武里省合并，形成今日特别直辖市的格局。","culture":"曼谷文化长期处于吸收与混合的状态。旧城区的店屋沿街排开，许多建筑保留着中葡式立面，寺庙、市场、百货公司和街边小贩彼此相邻。街头摊档遍布闹市，从早餐的粿条到深夜的炒饭，市民日常生活与这些临时摊位关系密切。尽管市政部门持续整顿人行道，街边食物的气味和节奏仍是城市最直接的辨认方式。\n\n佛教在这里的公共生活中仍然可见，但宗教在日常生活中的分量比过去轻。曼谷人把大量时间花在商场、咖啡馆和通勤路上，消费方式与物质选择越来越接近其他亚洲大都市。市中心的天铁与地铁叠在旧有街巷之上，河道里的公交船仍沿着昭披耶河运行。水面上是另一套时间感，慢且旧，与高架桥上的高峰期形成对照。","pull":"金顶之下，城市从河与街的缝隙里生长。","sights":[{"name":"大皇宫","orig":"พระบรมมหาราชวัง","intro":"拉玛一世迁都后兴建的宫殿群，曾是暹罗国王的官署与礼仪中心。建筑混合传统泰式屋顶与十九世纪欧洲新古典主义立面，最著名的却克里楼就有这种拼合。宫内玉佛寺供奉的翡翠佛像虽小，却是泰国地位最高的佛像。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/0005574_-_Wat_Phra_Kaew_006.jpg/960px-0005574_-_Wat_Phra_Kaew_006.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":639},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grand_Palace"},{"name":"卧佛寺","orig":"วัดโพธิ์","intro":"大皇宫南侧的大型佛寺，以室内长达四十六米的卧佛像为人所知。寺内还有大量碑刻和传统医学记录，泰式按摩学校也设于此。庭院阔大，廊下整齐排列的坐佛使这里比大皇宫更安静。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%98%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%8A%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%99.jpg/960px-%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%98%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%8A%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%99.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1440},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wat_Pho"},{"name":"黎明寺","orig":"วัดอรุณ","intro":"位于昭披耶河西岸，主塔高约六十至八十八米，四周由四座小塔围绕。塔面镶嵌彩色中国碎瓷片，近看纹理细密，远看轮廓锋利。十泰铢硬币背面即为此塔轮廓，是曼谷最易辨认的地标之一。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%98%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%84%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%932.jpg/960px-%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%98%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%84%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%932.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BB%8E%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%BA"},{"name":"金山寺","orig":"วัดสระเกศ","intro":"建在人造假山上的佛寺，从山脚经螺旋石阶走到塔前，可俯瞰旧城一带的屋顶与街道。拉玛二世、三世时期起逐步修筑，金色佛塔内据说藏有佛舍利。天气清朗时，是旧城中视野最从容的高处。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A8-2.jpg/960px-%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A8-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":641},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wat_Saket"},{"name":"汤普生博物馆","orig":"พิพิธภัณฑ์จิม ทอมป์สัน","intro":"原为美国商人吉姆·汤普生的住宅，由六座传统泰式木屋拆解后拼合而成。室内保留其生前收藏的东南亚艺术品，屋外有花园与水道。建筑本身即是一个关于柚木、阴影和炎热气候的样本。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/29/Jim_Thompson_house.jpg/960px-Jim_Thompson_house.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1379},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B9%AF%E6%99%AE%E7%94%9F%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A4%A8"}],"foods":[{"name":"泰式炒粿条","orig":"ผัดไทย","intro":"河粉与鸡蛋、鱼露、罗望子酱和辣椒同炒，可加鸡肉或虾。味道偏酸甜，常配花生碎与青柠。路边摊和小店最常见，现点现炒，是曼谷最日常也最外地人友好的街头食物。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Phat_Thai_kung_Chang_Khien_street_stall.jpg/960px-Phat_Thai_kung_Chang_Khien_street_stall.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":960},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pad_thai"},{"name":"冬荫功","orig":"ต้มยำกุ้ง","intro":"以虾、香茅、南姜、青柠叶和辣椒煮成的酸辣虾汤，香气浓烈，辣度显著。街边小店与海鲜餐馆都有供应，配饭或直接喝皆可。虾头熬出的鲜味是汤底厚度的来源。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Tom_yum.jpg/960px-Tom_yum.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":960},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%86%AC%E8%94%AD"},{"name":"海南鸡饭","orig":"ข้าวมันไก่","intro":"鸡肉以低温煮至嫩滑，切件后配鸡油饭，蘸辣酱或姜蓉。曼谷版本受潮州与海南传统影响，在唐人街一带尤其常见，是许多人从早市开始的午餐选择。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Thai_and_hoi_nan_chicken_in_half.jpg/960px-Thai_and_hoi_nan_chicken_in_half.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B5%B7%E5%8D%97%E9%9B%9E%E9%A3%AF"},{"name":"芒果糯米饭","orig":"ข้าวเหนียวมะม่วง","intro":"糯米拌椰浆蒸熟，配熟透芒果，再淋上少许椰汁。通常作为甜点或午后小吃，市内市场和甜品店都能找到。咸甜椰香与芒果酸度之间平衡得干脆，入口软而油润。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5d/Mango_sticy_rice_%283859549574%29.jpg/960px-Mango_sticy_rice_%283859549574%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%92%E6%9E%9C%E7%B3%AF%E7%B1%B3%E9%A5%AD"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/4Y1A1159_Bangkok_%2833536795515%29.jpg/1280px-4Y1A1159_Bangkok_%2833536795515%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":853},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/018-Sao_Ching_Cha.jpg/1280px-018-Sao_Ching_Cha.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":762}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[100.3278772,13.8041844],[100.3308149,13.7973172],[100.3335918,13.7839149],[100.3307661,13.7757118],[100.3301068,13.7623738],[100.333022,13.7602341],[100.3328049,13.7554403],[100.3341668,13.7552238],[100.3345209,13.7533399],[100.335423,13.7533856],[100.3357223,13.7415622],[100.3374773,13.736086],[100.3375551,13.7327312],[100.3349737,13.7320788],[100.3365,13.726595],[100.3363848,13.7229385],[100.332914,13.7211185],[100.3367908,13.7165651],[100.3360935,13.7154194],[100.3387886,13.7127688],[100.3364558,13.7108113],[100.335112,13.7111866],[100.3341247,13.713056],[100.3323161,13.7124642],[100.3334837,13.7082587],[100.3318416,13.7047525],[100.3324933,13.7048081],[100.3320764,13.6974392],[100.3312612,13.697297],[100.3324053,13.688421],[100.3344458,13.6822864],[100.3335559,13.6814723],[100.3360435,13.6769534],[100.33759,13.6773767],[100.3412211,13.6614256],[100.3394108,13.6549549],[100.3468372,13.6553335],[100.3462911,13.6491067],[100.3449524,13.6481324],[100.346066,13.643627],[100.3486598,13.6437201],[100.3484133,13.6409576],[100.3502464,13.6409675],[100.3515751,13.6395881],[100.3544174,13.6399596],[100.3554444,13.6365426],[100.3590282,13.637452],[100.3596097,13.6328715],[100.3659983,13.6336334],[100.3670467,13.6303791],[100.368698,13.6301318],[100.3716109,13.6249202],[100.3719665,13.6207948],[100.377107,13.6215079],[100.3777746,13.6209036],[100.3766392,13.6182958],[100.3785068,13.6133405],[100.3783265,13.6068945],[100.3771483,13.6065037],[100.3790688,13.5969427],[100.3785093,13.5942861],[100.3810375,13.5914376],[100.3843056,13.589572],[100.384197,13.5877099],[100.385119,13.5874899],[100.384883,13.5861446],[100.3860041,13.5850157],[100.385001,13.5791208],[100.3865973,13.5777968],[100.386672,13.5746494],[100.3879293,13.5742463],[100.3879924,13.5723585],[100.3888544,13.5729643],[100